# Claude Code session state.
#
# `launch.json` is shared dev configuration and IS tracked -- it records how to
# start the API and the Vite server, including the `app.serve` entry point that
# the checkpointer needs on Windows (see P15-023).
#
# Everything else under `.claude/` is per-session scratch. `worktrees/` in
# particular holds a full checked-out git worktree, so committing it would nest
# a second copy of the repository inside this one.
.claude/*
!.claude/launch.json
